\boxed{\text{quarters in the fourth pile}} &= \frac{2}{\boxed{1}} \\
\boxed{\text{quarters in the fourth pile}} &= 2 \text{ (quarters)}
\end{align*}

So, there are \boxed{2} quarters in the fourth pile.

